1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,900
给你10块钱，或者给你10万块——
Give you ¥10, or give you ¥100,000 —

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,960
在游戏里，你到底能买到什么？
what can you actually buy in a game?

3
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:11,320
很多人觉得：二游抽卡贵，MMO是无底洞。
People say gacha is pricey and MMOs are bottomless pits.

4
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:15,640
那就把8款热门游戏，放进同一张图里比一比。
So let's put 8 hit games on one chart.

5
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:20,360
横轴是花的钱：从10块起步，每一格翻10倍。
X-axis: money spent. From ¥10, every step is ×10.

6
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:24,860
这叫对数坐标：10、100、1000、1万、10万。
That's a log scale: 10, 100, 1K, 10K, 100K.

7
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:29,340
纵轴是你换来的真实体验。
Y-axis: the experience you actually get.

8
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:33,480
底部红线叫"氪了白氪"，顶部金线叫"彻底氪穿"。
Red floor: "money wasted". Gold ceiling: "maxed out".

9
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,540
8款游戏，两两分组，四场对决。
8 games. 4 head-to-head matchups.

10
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:41,500
每条曲线背后，都是一套精心设计的数学。
Behind every curve is carefully designed math.

11
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:46,860
第一组：同为抽卡二游的《原神》和《恋与深空》。
Round 1: Genshin Impact vs Love and Deepspace.

12
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:51,260
在10块钱档位，两条线都贴着红线。
At ¥10, both curves hug the red floor.

13
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:57,020
原神1抽160原石≈16元，恋与深空1抽150钻≈15元。
One Genshin pull ≈ ¥16. One Deepspace pull ≈ ¥15.

14
00:00:57,140 --> 00:01:00,260
10块钱，连一发单抽都凑不齐。
¥10 can't even buy a single pull.

15
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:04,800
到了100块：30元月卡 + 68元通行证，
At ¥100: a ¥30 monthly pass + a ¥68 battle pass —

16
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:07,320
两条曲线第一次猛冲。
both curves make their first big jump.

17
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:11,140
但月卡的本质，是一笔"时间赎买税"。
But the monthly pass is really a "time tax".

18
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:15,640
一天不上线就少拿90原石——它买的是你的日活。
Miss a day, lose 90 Primogems. It's buying your daily logins.

19
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:19,100
真正的分水岭，在1000块。
The real turning point: ¥1,000.

20
00:01:19,220 --> 00:01:23,240
二游有"保底"：90抽小保底，180抽大保底。
Gacha has pity: 90 pulls soft, 180 pulls guaranteed.

21
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:28,460
1000块左右拿下0命新角色，已拿走80%核心体验。
~¥1,000 lands a new C0 character: 80% of the core experience.

22
00:01:29,780 --> 00:01:33,440
再砸到1万块抽满6命，花费涨了十倍，
Spend ¥10,000 for C6 — ten times the cost —

23
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:37,220
换来的只是怪活不过三秒的数值溢出。
and all you get is overkill: bosses melt in 3 seconds.

24
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:41,580
《原神》有近百个角色，卖的是"横向配队积木"；
Genshin sells ~100 characters as team-building blocks;

25
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:46,080
《恋与深空》只有5位男主，卖的是"排他的恋爱深度"。
Deepspace has just 5 leads — it sells exclusive romance.

26
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:50,800
日卡成套、叠阶换色，再包下商圈大屏为他庆生——
Card sets, upgrades, birthday billboards downtown —

27
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:54,760
当氪金变成"爱的证明"，曲线就被一路拉直。
when spending is "proof of love", the curve never flattens.

28
00:01:56,330 --> 00:02:00,710
第二组：SLG《无尽冬日》对决MMO《逆水寒》手游。
Round 2: Whiteout Survival vs Justice Online Mobile.

29
00:02:00,830 --> 00:02:05,030
如果说二游是平行宇宙，这里就是"S型修罗场"。
If gacha is a parallel universe, this is an S-curve arena.

30
00:02:05,550 --> 00:02:09,210
从10块、100块，一直到1000块——
From ¥10 to ¥100, all the way to ¥1,000 —

31
00:02:09,330 --> 00:02:12,270
两条曲线几乎贴着地板爬行。
both curves barely leave the floor.

32
00:02:12,790 --> 00:02:17,890
《无尽冬日》：充了1000块的城，被大佬一次集结夷为平地。
Whiteout: a ¥1,000 city, flattened by one whale rally.

33
00:02:18,010 --> 00:02:22,210
《逆水寒》：1000块，连一颗天赏石都保底不了。
Justice: ¥1,000 can't even guarantee one Tianshang Stone.

34
00:02:22,330 --> 00:02:26,890
微氪玩家不是消费者，而是免费的"NPC和气氛组"。
Light spenders aren't customers. They're free NPCs and extras.

35
00:02:27,410 --> 00:02:31,970
只有冲过1万、迈向10万，跨过"服务器前排"阈值线，
Only past ¥10K, toward ¥100K, over the "server elite" line,

36
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:34,310
曲线才会垂直起飞。
does the curve finally take off.

37
00:02:35,430 --> 00:02:38,910
《无尽冬日》卖的是旧时代的"丛林暴力"：
Whiteout sells old-school jungle power:

38
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:42,870
花30万当"车头"，把几百个平民当煤炭烧。
¥300K makes you the engine, burning hundreds of players as coal.

39
00:02:43,390 --> 00:02:47,410
《逆水寒》官方承诺不卖数值，卖的是"审美景观"：
Justice promises no pay-to-win. It sells spectacle:

40
00:02:47,530 --> 00:02:52,090
十几万到上百万的神赐顶奢外观，能改变全服天相。
¥150K–¥1M+ luxury outfits that change the whole sky.

41
00:02:52,210 --> 00:02:56,590
零氪玩家从"被砍的炮灰"，变成"帮大佬截图的群演"。
Free players go from cannon fodder to extras taking photos.

42
00:02:57,110 --> 00:03:00,410
而这两条线，永远没有真正的上限。
And these two curves have no real ceiling.

43
00:03:01,980 --> 00:03:05,280
第三组：《王者荣耀》对决《三角洲行动》。
Round 3: Honor of Kings vs Delta Force.

44
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:09,960
主打公平竞技，不卖攻击力——所以曲线从40%起步。
They sell fairness, not firepower — so they start at 40%.

45
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:15,400
100块以内体验极佳：6元皮肤、38元战令，手感拉满；
Under ¥100 it feels great: a ¥6 skin, a ¥38 battle pass.

46
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:20,080
三角洲买的是安全箱：撤离失败，也能保住一件大红。
Delta sells the safe box: die, and your best loot still survives.

47
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:24,800
到了1000块，王者的单英雄体验就到头了：
At ¥1,000, one hero is maxed out:

48
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:29,120
一局只能穿一件皮肤，第5件的边际效用≈0。
One skin per match — the 5th one adds ≈ nothing.

49
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:32,760
于是王者发明了"社交货币通胀"：
So HoK invented social-currency inflation:

50
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:37,800
史诗、无双、荣耀典藏、V10，再到无双V10、荣耀V10……
Epic, Legend, Glory Collection, V10, then Unrivaled & Glory V10…

51
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:41,040
直到10万块全皮肤，彻底氪穿。
until ¥100K buys every skin. Fully maxed.

52
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:46,740
三角洲：买完北极星刀皮，再把1万块换成哈夫币，
Delta: buy the Polaris knife, turn ¥10K into Hafu coins,

53
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:50,340
满改M7、六套甲、金弹，杀进绝密航天。
full-mod M7, tier-6 armor, gold ammo — into Top-Secret Space Base.

54
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:54,700
曲线变成心电图：被草丛老六一梭子修脚，
The curve turns into an ECG: one ambush from a bush camper,

55
00:03:54,820 --> 00:03:58,480
全套装备1秒清零，成了别人的战利品。
and your whole kit is gone in a second — someone else's loot.

56
00:04:00,050 --> 00:04:03,350
最后一组：买断制单机《黑神话：悟空》，
Final round: buy-to-play Black Myth: Wukong

57
00:04:03,470 --> 00:04:06,230
对决国民棋牌《欢乐斗地主》。
vs the national card game, Happy Landlord.

58
00:04:06,750 --> 00:04:10,050
10块钱：《黑神话》连游戏都买不到；
At ¥10: you can't even buy Wukong;

59
00:04:10,170 --> 00:04:13,290
《欢乐斗地主》6元首充，当场开局。
Landlord gets you playing with a ¥6 first top-up.

60
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:16,140
但到了268元——
But at ¥268 —

61
00:04:16,260 --> 00:04:20,280
《黑神话》一棒子90度拉满，直接捅穿天花板！
Wukong's curve shoots straight up and smashes the ceiling!

62
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:23,700
没有月卡，没有保底，没有排位焦虑。
No passes. No pity. No ranked anxiety.

63
00:04:24,820 --> 00:04:29,560
1万块，够一个Steam玩家买下几十部3A大作。
¥10K buys a Steam player dozens of AAA games.

64
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:34,640
而《欢乐斗地主》才刚露出獠牙：豆子不是商品，是筹码。
Landlord is just getting started: beans aren't goods, they're chips.

65
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:38,780
抢地主、明牌、超级加倍、炸弹、春天……倍数一路翻。
Bid, show hand, super double, bombs, spring… the stakes multiply.

66
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:43,140
十万块的豆子，3分钟就能输得一干二净——
¥100K of beans can vanish in three minutes —

67
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:47,100
然后系统贴心地弹出：6元破产救济礼包。
then a friendly pop-up: "¥6 bankruptcy rescue pack!"

68
00:04:48,670 --> 00:04:51,970
现在，把8条曲线叠在同一张图上。
Now, stack all 8 curves on one chart.

69
00:04:53,090 --> 00:04:56,390
垂直线：买断制，268元一步到位。
The vertical line: buy-to-play, done at ¥268.

70
00:04:56,510 --> 00:05:01,610
对数线：二游用30元买时间，1000元交出80%体验。
The log curves: gacha buys your time at ¥30, gives 80% at ¥1K.

71
00:05:01,730 --> 00:05:05,390
阶梯与心电图：一个卖排面，一个卖心跳。
Stairs and heartbeats: one sells status, one sells adrenaline.

72
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:09,710
S型无底洞：千元以下当群演，十万以上买特权。
The S-curves: extras below ¥1K, privileges above ¥100K.

73
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:13,410
百元以内，你买的是时间；
Under ¥100, you buy time.

74
00:05:13,530 --> 00:05:16,650
千元档位，你买的是内容和陪伴；
Around ¥1,000, you buy content and companionship.

75
00:05:16,770 --> 00:05:21,330
十万以上，你买的是凌驾于他人之上的目光与权力。
Above ¥100K, you buy attention — and power over others.

76
00:05:23,050 --> 00:05:26,890
你的游戏预算，停在哪条曲线的哪个刻度？
Where does your gaming budget sit on these curves?

77
00:05:27,010 --> 00:05:29,410
评论区打出你的坐标！
Drop your coordinates in the comments!

